    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story &amp; Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to join an extraordinary adventure and help these talented virtual girls on their path to success? Step into their world with \u300aOG Streamer Beats\u300b, a unique blend of platforming excitement and rhythm-based gameplay that will inspire and energize you. Get your virtual boots on, adjust your headphones, and immerse yourself in the dynamic beats that will guide your journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189470/extras/a0c3634771551cba06f1f889dc8982d5.poster.avif?t=1755279489\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189470/extras/a0c3634771551cba06f1f889dc8982d5.webm?t=1755279489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189470/extras/a0c3634771551cba06f1f889dc8982d5.mp4?t=1755279489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the Virtual Persona:</strong> Play as one of four captivating Vtubers, each with their unique style and personality, as they strive for virtual stardom.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189470/extras/a90da59a8548664af979e607b7689222.avif?t=1755279489\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gift-Giving System: </strong>Boost your relationships by giving thoughtful gifts to the characters, each tailored to their unique tastes, to increase affection and unlock special scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Special Sexy CG Animation:</strong> Earn Live2d animated CG scenes for each character by progressing through their romance arc and making key decisions, capturing memorable moments in your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Virtual Fame: </strong>Witness the rise of virtual stars and take part in their journey as they aim for global fame.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm-Platforming Hybrid: </strong>Experience the thrill of platforming combined with rhythm-based mechanics, delivering a one-of-a-kind, addictive gameplay experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189470/extras/b4740278749836b4b0e9ae39c0867cb6.poster.avif?t=1755279489\" width=588 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189470/extras/b4740278749836b4b0e9ae39c0867cb6.webm?t=1755279489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189470/extras/b4740278749836b4b0e9ae39c0867cb6.mp4?t=1755279489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Soundtrack: </strong>Enjoy a collection of 16 carefully curated songs, each enhancing the atmosphere and intensity of every level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Visuals:</strong> Explore visually striking virtual worlds, each crafted to reflect the Vtubers' personalities and career progress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to take on this rhythmic adventure and guide your Vtubers to virtual stardom in \u300aOG Streamer Beats\u300b!</p>",
